ompliance / Tax confirm it applies, with a few small scoping questions still open.", "formula": null}, {"label": "Independent second-line validation Has an independent team — not the sponsor — formally signed this off? / Business [BC]", "value": "3 — A control function has looked at it informally, but there's no formal sign-off.", "formula": null}, {"label": "Validity score [BD]", "value": 3.5, "formula": null}, {"label": "Validated must-do? [BE]", "value": "YES", "formula": null}, {"label": "Minimum-viable scope Are we doing only what the rule requires, or adding 'nice-to-have' extras on top? / Business [BF]", "value": "4 — Lean — scope is limited to compliance, with small, justified allowances.", "formula": null}, {"label": "Impact — how serious the consequence is if we don't comply If we don't comply, how serious is the consequence? / Business [BG]", "value": "3 — Meaningful fine, a reportable finding, or a limited restriction on the business.", "formula": null}, {"label": "Likelihood — how likely it is to happen if we don't act How likely is it to actually happen if we don't act? / Business [BH]", "value": "3 — Possible — there's general enforcement in this area and periodic audits.", "formula": null}, {"label": "Deadline — how close the mandatory date is How soon is the date by which we must comply? / Business [BI]", "value": "3 — Between six months and a year away.", "formula": null}, {"label": "Expo- sure [BJ]", "value": 9, "formula": null}, {"label": "Exp. band [BK]", "value": "Medium", "formula": null}, {"label": "Priority tier [BL]", "value": "P2 — Scheduled", "formula": null}, {"label": "Overall AOP decision [BM]", "value": "HEALTHY / MUST-DO — P2 — Scheduled", "formula": null}, {"label": "Remarks / evidence [BN]", "value": 0, "formula": null}]

